# Kept in the repo, never shipped to the production domain.
#
# public/proto is a design specimen. Its outlet names are real and every score,
# quote, person and bill in it is invented. That is fine in a repo where the
# banner and this file explain it. It is not fine on chooseyourbias.com, where
# a fabricated number beside a real newsroom's name would be the first thing
# anyone found. Reviewed on the `design` branch, which ships it to a preview URL.
# public/proto -- served on this branch for design review

